  <entry>
    <title>华通一体机报工操作手册</title>
    <url>/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/</url>
    <content><![CDATA[<h1 id="华通一体机报工操作手册"><a href="#华通一体机报工操作手册" class="headerlink" title="华通一体机报工操作手册"></a>华通一体机报工操作手册</h1><hr>
<h2 id="📋-目录"><a href="#📋-目录" class="headerlink" title="📋 目录"></a>📋 目录</h2><ol>
<li><a href="#1-%E5%89%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%87%86%E5%A4%87">前置准备</a>  </li>
<li><a href="#2-%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95">登录</a>  </li>
<li><a href="#3-%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%8D">选择工位</a>  </li>
<li><a href="#4-%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%E6%89%93%E5%8D%B0">标签打印</a>  </li>
<li><a href="#5-%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5">生产报工</a>  </li>
<li><a href="#6-%E8%87%AA%E6%A3%80%E6%8A%A5%E5%BA%9F">自检报废</a></li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h2 id="1-前置准备"><a href="#1-前置准备" class="headerlink" title="1. 前置准备"></a>1. 前置准备</h2><ul>
<li><strong>账号</strong>：由系统管理员进行创建  </li>
<li><strong>APP 软件</strong>：确保一体机已安装最新版报工应用</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id="2-登录"><a href="#2-登录" class="headerlink" title="2. 登录"></a>2. 登录</h2><p>一体机登录方式：输入<strong>工号后四位</strong>（例如 <code>0796</code>）  </p>
<p><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image1.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image1.png" alt="登录界面"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">登录界面</span></div></div><br><em>（输入工号后四位即可进入主界面）</em></p>
<hr>
<h2 id="3-选择工位"><a href="#3-选择工位" class="headerlink" title="3. 选择工位"></a>3. 选择工位</h2><ol>
<li>点击主页面上方红框中的 <strong>“工位信息”</strong> 按钮。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image2.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image2.png" alt="工位信息按钮"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">工位信息按钮</span></div></div>  </li>
<li>根据当前实际生产位置，选择对应的工位。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image3.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image3.png" alt="选择工位"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">选择工位</span></div></div></li>
</ol>
<blockquote>
<p>⚠️ <strong>注意</strong>：选错工位会导致报工数据异常，请务必确认。</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2 id="4-标签打印"><a href="#4-标签打印" class="headerlink" title="4. 标签打印"></a>4. 标签打印</h2><p>标签打印根据产品情况分为两种场景，请按实际条件选择对应操作。</p>
<h3 id="场景一：没有机边检验的产品"><a href="#场景一：没有机边检验的产品" class="headerlink" title="场景一：没有机边检验的产品"></a>场景一：没有机边检验的产品</h3><blockquote>
<p>适用于机边检验成品没有人的情况，模板需选择“一物一码注塑流转卡”。</p>
</blockquote>
<p>操作步骤：</p>
<ol>
<li>从主页面下方点击 <strong>“标签打印”</strong> 按钮。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image4.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image4.png" alt="标签打印入口"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">标签打印入口</span></div></div></li>
<li><strong>首次打印</strong>该产品时，需配置模板：  <ul>
<li>点击“模板配置”，按提示设置对应参数。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image5.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image5.png" alt="模板配置1"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">模板配置1</span></div></div><br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image6.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image6.png" alt="模板配置2"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">模板配置2</span></div></div></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>配置完成后，即可正常打印标签。</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h3 id="场景二：产品编号以“2”开头的产品"><a href="#场景二：产品编号以“2”开头的产品" class="headerlink" title="场景二：产品编号以“2”开头的产品"></a>场景二：产品编号以“2”开头的产品</h3><blockquote>
<p>适用于产品编号以 <strong>2</strong> 开头的情况，模板需选择“注塑装箱单模板”。</p>
</blockquote>
<p>操作步骤：</p>
<ol>
<li>从主页面下方点击 <strong>“标签打印”</strong> 按钮。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image4.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image4.png" alt="标签打印入口"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">标签打印入口</span></div></div></li>
<li><strong>首次打印</strong>该产品时，需配置模板：  <ul>
<li>点击“模板配置”，选择 <strong>注塑装箱单模板</strong>，按提示设置对应参数。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E8%A3%85%E7%AE%B1%E5%8D%95%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E8%A3%85%E7%AE%B1%E5%8D%95%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE.png" alt="注塑装箱单模板"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">注塑装箱单模板</span></div></div><br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image6.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image6.png" alt="模板配置2"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">模板配置2</span></div></div></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>配置完成后，即可正常打印标签。</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h2 id="5-生产报工"><a href="#5-生产报工" class="headerlink" title="5. 生产报工"></a>5. 生产报工</h2><p>完成工位选择（以及标签打印）后，返回主页面，点击下方的 <strong>“生产报工”</strong> 按钮。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image7.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image7.png" alt="生产报工入口"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">生产报工入口</span></div></div></p>
<h3 id="重要要求"><a href="#重要要求" class="headerlink" title="重要要求"></a>重要要求</h3><ul>
<li><p><strong>工时填报</strong>：同一产品多次报工时，<strong>仅最后一次</strong>需要填写工时，前几次可不填。  </p>
</li>
<li><p><strong>工单状态检查</strong>（必须注意）：  </p>
<div class="table-responsive">
<table class="table table-bordered table-striped">
<thead>
<tr>
<th align="left">工单状态</th>
<th align="left">是否允许报工</th>
<th align="left">处理方式</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td align="left"><strong>下发</strong></td>
<td align="left">❌ 不允许</td>
<td align="left">联系班组长开启工单</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left"><strong>进行中</strong></td>
<td align="left">✅ 允许</td>
<td align="left">正常报工</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left"><strong>完成 &#x2F; 强制结单</strong></td>
<td align="left">❌ 禁止</td>
<td align="left">切勿再报工，否则数据作废</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
</li>
</ul>
<p><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image8.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image8.png" alt="工单状态示例"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">工单状态示例</span></div></div></p>
<blockquote>
<p>⚠️ 若状态为“下发”或“完成&#x2F;强制结单”，请勿强行报工，否则会报错。</p>
</blockquote>
<hr>
<h2 id="6-自检报废"><a href="#6-自检报废" class="headerlink" title="6. 自检报废"></a>6. 自检报废</h2><ol>
<li>点击主页面左上角的 <strong>返回</strong> 按钮，回到主界面。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image9.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image9.png" alt="返回按钮"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">返回按钮</span></div></div>  </li>
<li>在主界面点击下方的 <strong>“自检报废”</strong> 按钮。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image10.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image10.png" alt="自检报废入口"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">自检报废入口</span></div></div>  </li>
<li>按页面图示填写报废数量、原因等信息，确认提交。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image11.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/05/%E5%8D%8E%E9%80%9A%E6%B3%A8%E5%A1%91%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BASOP/image11.png" alt="自检报废操作"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">自检报废操作</span></div></div></li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h2 id="📌-更新记录"><a href="#📌-更新记录" class="headerlink" title="📌 更新记录"></a>📌 更新记录</h2><div class="table-responsive">
<table class="table table-bordered table-striped">
<thead>
<tr>
<th align="left">版本</th>
<th align="left">日期</th>
<th align="left">更新内容</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td align="left">v1.0</td>
<td align="left">2026-08-05</td>
<td align="left">初始版本，覆盖生产提报与自检报废全流程</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left">v1.1</td>
<td align="left">2026-08-05</td>
<td align="left">调整第4节“标签打印”，拆分为两种场景，优化结构，删除多余标题</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<hr>
<blockquote>
<p>💡 <strong>温馨提示</strong>：操作中如遇异常或报错，请立即联系现场班组长或 IT 支持人员，切勿自行盲目操作。</p>
</blockquote>
]]></content>
