<p><a id="select-station"></a></p>
<h3 id="2-2-选择工位"><a href="#2-2-选择工位" class="headerlink" title="2.2 选择工位"></a>2.2 选择工位</h3><ol>
<li><p>点击主页面中的 <strong>“工位信息”</strong> 按钮（红框标识），进入选工位页面。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image2.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image2.png" alt="工位信息按钮"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">工位信息按钮</span></div></div></p>
</li>
<li><p>根据当前实际生产的机台，选择对应的工位。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image3.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image3.png" alt="选择工位"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">选择工位</span></div></div></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<p><a id="print-label"></a></p>
<h3 id="2-3-标签模板配置与打印"><a href="#2-3-标签模板配置与打印" class="headerlink" title="2.3 标签模板配置与打印"></a>2.3 标签模板配置与打印</h3><ol>
<li><p>点击主页面下方的 <strong>“标签打印”</strong> 按钮，进入标签打印页面。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image4.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image4.png" alt="标签打印按钮"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">标签打印按钮</span></div></div></p>
</li>
<li><p><strong>首次打印</strong>该产品时，需要先配置模板：点击“模板配置”，选择正确的模板文件。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image5.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image5.png" alt="模板配置"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">模板配置</span></div></div></p>
</li>
<li><p>模板选择完成后，输入需要打印的数量，点击打印即可生成标签。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image6.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image6.png" alt="标签打印示例"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">标签打印示例</span></div></div></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<p><a id="report"></a></p>
<h2 id="3️⃣-生产提报（APP端）"><a href="#3️⃣-生产提报（APP端）" class="headerlink" title="3️⃣ 生产提报（APP端）"></a>3️⃣ 生产提报（APP端）</h2><p>生产提报需在手机 APP 上完成，请确保已安装并登录。</p>
<p><a id="app-login"></a></p>
<h3 id="3-1-用户登录"><a href="#3-1-用户登录" class="headerlink" title="3.1 用户登录"></a>3.1 用户登录</h3><div class="table-responsive">
<table class="table table-bordered table-striped">
<thead>
<tr>
<th align="left">项目</th>
<th align="left">说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td align="left"><strong>用户名</strong></td>
<td align="left">手机号码</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="left"><strong>密码</strong></td>
<td align="left"><code>123</code>（初始密码，建议首次登录后修改）</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image7.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image7.png" alt="APP登录"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">APP登录</span></div></div></p>
<hr>
<p><a id="scan-report"></a></p>
<h3 id="3-2-扫码报工流程"><a href="#3-2-扫码报工流程" class="headerlink" title="3.2 扫码报工流程"></a>3.2 扫码报工流程</h3><blockquote>
<p><strong>整体流程</strong>：扫码定位工单 → 依次扫入所有报工标签 → 填写班次日期 → 确认提交</p>
</blockquote>
<h4 id="步骤详解"><a href="#步骤详解" class="headerlink" title="步骤详解"></a>步骤详解</h4><ol>
<li><p>登录 APP 后，点击底部 <strong>“工作台”</strong>，然后选择 <strong>“生产提报”</strong>。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image8.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image8.png" alt="工作台-生产提报"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">工作台-生产提报</span></div></div></p>
</li>
<li><p><strong>第一次扫码</strong>：扫描打印好的标签二维码，系统自动定位到对应的工单。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image9.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image9.png" alt="定位工单1"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">定位工单1</span></div></div></p>
</li>
<li><p>点击进入工单详情页面，将需要报工的所有标签依次扫码。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image10.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image10.png" alt="定位工单2"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">定位工单2</span></div></div></p>
</li>
<li><p>填写 <strong>报工班次</strong> 和 <strong>报工日期</strong>，确认所有信息无误后，点击 <strong>提交</strong>。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image11.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image11.png" alt="定位工单3"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">定位工单3</span></div></div></p>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 id="⚠️-其他重要要求"><a href="#⚠️-其他重要要求" class="headerlink" title="⚠️ 其他重要要求"></a>⚠️ 其他重要要求</h4><ul>
<li><strong>工时填报</strong>：同一产品多次报工时，<strong>只需在最后一次填报工时</strong>，前面无需重复填写。</li>
<li><strong>工单状态限制</strong>：<ul>
<li>❌ <strong>状态为“下发”</strong>：无法提报，需联系班组长开启工单。</li>
<li>❌ <strong>状态为“完成”或“强制结单”</strong>：<strong>禁止再报工</strong>，请核对工单状态。</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p><a id="modify-report"></a></p>
<h3 id="3-3-生产提报记录修改"><a href="#3-3-生产提报记录修改" class="headerlink" title="3.3 生产提报记录修改"></a>3.3 生产提报记录修改</h3><blockquote>
<p><strong>适用说明</strong>：如需修改已提交的提报记录（仅支持修改部分字段），按以下步骤操作。</p>
</blockquote>
<ol>
<li><p>回到 <strong>工作台</strong>，点击 <strong>“生产提报记录”</strong>。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image12.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image12.png" alt="生产提报记录修改"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">生产提报记录修改</span></div></div></p>
</li>
<li><p>找到需要修改的记录，点击 <strong>修改</strong> 按钮，在允许的字段（如工时、备注等）中更新信息，确认后提交。</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<p><a id="scrap"></a></p>
<h2 id="4️⃣-自检报废"><a href="#4️⃣-自检报废" class="headerlink" title="4️⃣ 自检报废"></a>4️⃣ 自检报废</h2><p>当产品出现不良品需要报废时，通过此功能进行登记。</p>
<p><a id="scrap-submit"></a></p>
<h3 id="4-1-自检报废提交"><a href="#4-1-自检报废提交" class="headerlink" title="4.1 自检报废提交"></a>4.1 自检报废提交</h3><ol>
<li><p>回到 <strong>工作台</strong>，点击 <strong>“自检报废”</strong> 图标。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image13.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image13.png" alt="自检报废入口"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">自检报废入口</span></div></div></p>
</li>
<li><p>定位工单有两种方式（任选其一）：</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>方式一（推荐）</strong>：按 <strong>产品名称</strong> 搜索，系统列出该产品所有工单，再根据工序描述和工位定位。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image14.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image14.png" alt="按名称搜索"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">按名称搜索</span></div></div></li>
<li><strong>方式二</strong>：直接扫描打印标签上的二维码，系统自动定位工单。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image15.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image15.png" alt="扫码定位"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">扫码定位</span></div></div></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><p>进入自检报废详情页，填写报废数量、报废原因等信息，确认后提交。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image16.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image16.png" alt="自检报废填写"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">自检报废填写</span></div></div></p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr>
<p><a id="scrap-cancel"></a></p>
<h3 id="4-2-自检报废记录撤销"><a href="#4-2-自检报废记录撤销" class="headerlink" title="4.2 自检报废记录撤销"></a>4.2 自检报废记录撤销</h3><p>如需撤销已提交的报废记录，操作如下：</p>
<ol>
<li>回到 <strong>工作台</strong>，点击 <strong>“自检报废记录”</strong>。</li>
<li>找到需要撤销的记录，点击下方的 <strong>撤销</strong> 按钮，系统确认后该记录将被撤销（数据恢复）。<br><div class="img-item" data-src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image17.png" data-sub-html=".caption"><img src="/2026/08/08/%E9%B8%BF%E5%A4%A9%E3%80%81%E8%80%81%E5%8E%82%E6%8A%A5%E5%B7%A5%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/image17.png" alt="自检报废撤销"><div class="img-caption d-block text-center"><span class="center-caption text-muted border-bottom">自检报废撤销</span></div></div></li>
</ol>
<hr>
